<title>USA: Citicorp files $5 bln debt, equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Citicorp files $5 bln debt, equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $5 billion in notes, preferred shares, common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, principally to fund investments in the company's subsidiaries, according to the shelf offering.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
